{"title":"Career roadmap — Performance Tester","role":"Performance Tester","summary":"A Performance Tester evaluates how applications behave under different levels of traffic, load, stress, and concurrency. The role focuses on response time, throughput, scalability, resource utilisation, bottlenecks, and system stability.","facts":{"Current degree":"BCA (Bachelor of Computer Applications)","Course":"BCA – Software Testing / QA"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a BCA student, the strongest route is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Software Testing fundamentals","Manual Testing","SQL + APIs","Performance Testing tools","Scripting","Monitoring","Cloud","Performance Engineering"]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","What to focus on"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Manual testing, SDLC/STLC, SQL, API testing, Java/Python, HTTP, Linux, JMeter, LoadRunner/Gatling basics"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Advanced performance testing, distributed load testing, APM, cloud performance, CI/CD, bottleneck analysis"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Performance Engineering, SRE collaboration, scalability architecture, capacity planning, observability"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"AI-assisted performance engineering, autonomous testing, cloud-scale optimisation, resilience engineering, technical leadership"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Testing + programming foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Software Development Life Cycle — SDLC"},{"text":"Software Testing Life Cycle — STLC"},{"text":"Manual testing"},{"text":"Test cases and test scenarios"},{"text":"Bug lifecycle"},{"text":"Functional vs non-functional testing"},{"text":"Regression testing"},{"text":"Smoke and sanity testing"},{"text":"Boundary-value analysis"},{"text":"Equivalence partitioning"},{"text":"Basic Java or Python"},{"text":"SQL fundamentals"},{"text":"Git/GitHub"},{"text":"Basic Linux"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Application","API","Database","Server","Network","User"]},{"type":"p","text":"A performance tester eventually needs to understand how the entire stack interacts."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Automation + API testing"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HTTP/HTTPS"},{"text":"REST APIs"},{"text":"JSON/XML"},{"text":"Postman"},{"text":"API testing"},{"text":"Authentication"},{"text":"OAuth/JWT basics"},{"text":"HTTP status codes"},{"text":"Cookies and sessions"},{"text":"SQL joins and subqueries"},{"text":"Java/Python scripting"},{"text":"Selenium basics"},{"text":"Git"},{"text":"Maven/Gradle basics"},{"text":"CI/CD fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"REST API testing project"},{"text":"Automated regression test suite"},{"text":"API test collection using Postman"},{"text":"SQL-based test-data validation project"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Performance testing specialisation"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Load testing"},{"text":"Stress testing"},{"text":"Spike testing"},{"text":"Endurance/soak testing"},{"text":"Volume testing"},{"text":"Scalability testing"},{"text":"Baseline testing"},{"text":"Capacity testing"},{"text":"Concurrency"},{"text":"Throughput"},{"text":"Response time"},{"text":"Percentiles — P90/P95/P99"},{"text":"Error rate"},{"text":"Transactions per second"},{"text":"Requests per second"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Primary tools:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Apache JMeter"},{"text":"LoadRunner"},{"text":"Gatling"},{"text":"k6"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Start with JMeter, then learn at least one modern scripting-oriented tool such as k6 or Gatling."},{"type":"h","text":"Final year — Performance engineering projects"},{"type":"p","text":"Build portfolio projects